    `Father, I come to You today in the middle of everything that feels out of control — the personal crises, the unanswered questions, the situations that no human hand seems capable of governing. And I receive today the truth that has not changed regardless of how the circumstances feel: You are still enthroned. Your throne was established before any of this began. You are from all eternity, and the shaking of my world has not moved You one inch from the throne You have occupied since before time began. Let the vision of Isaiah 6 be mine today — let me see, in the year of whatever is dying around me, the Lord high and exalted, seated, the train of His robe filling the temple. Let the Revelation 4 perspective reframe everything I am looking at — whatever is happening on earth, Someone is on the throne in heaven, and He is not scrambling. You reign today. That is enough.`
